: "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827867_589180484142828_266929031235457912_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hy-X69Odzr4Q7kNvwGweGRp&_nc_oc=AdkHvz_aoD9mlJ57aQaFPHdeSkZ4BMj4OD6lM69S8i-vB_IS0FdCcGzzwcrqCPHHMdM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGTBsFCE9x1gXHw8MxQG0E3TCS8YsqrosFgewxboWfjg&oe=699996C5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0000_Screenshot-2025-04-10-113143.png", "id": "1176925730331466", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_1176925733664799_3790371368702893484_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5rC19rzA0K8Q7kNvwG_E5tH&_nc_oc=Adn2VUlrJkUOe7LE31lSGfMckq9CKqdp7CzoXmWdlgj-ksc0nyDS-_oUIQLD7JttQDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv2O9aial23CIwVsLOyXwyKAPNZ1MoD0ZiGslZr3rajfw&oe=69999A4E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0003_Screenshot-2025-04-10-112403.png", "id": "1018396219679557", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828895_1018396223012890_5107840577383576045_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qSPNvdJ-NGUQ7kNvwFblJR3&_nc_oc=Adkj_7M5xpS5fe83ZbEiZlvvbmmA7D4QU3YHj7qGnhf29_1Cv7ggqF584zdEdXWVjq8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvrMuxjMscXudd5MOK6rqE6M4PCe9hpK29q88EgpVez1w&oe=69999EB8"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0004_Screenshot-2025-04-10-112719.png", "id": "2091812787933632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830787_2091812791266965_7439820487698740197_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jBvFojpQJe0Q7kNvwGgvJjB&_nc_oc=Adlp6Vygelzb9YE4ADo_rloxSOKQfHaZnKxC3l41S4BJXCOItEsjYNXfbH9paVCK8r8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuXtk8aHETOoemLZ4AWSSV1TvSukvw9w4QTJfyyKJnQdg&oe=6999A3E7"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0001_Screenshot-2025-04-10-113005.png", "id": "1391575151856032", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827031_1391575158522698_4796616866213924747_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=isctujO3BKQQ7kNvwG741e_&_nc_oc=Adm4yrJK8l8GWwnJ8aHfTe-YiTsLzMhmB5WEiJRV1whlHx3OTp-VQAakeFrTyZnUhVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvRBBTJj1pJ3XaGvl3BpLhKfnXrvrTnkaicFgPXPDF2vA&oe=6999B2B1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "COVER TRAILER.png", "id": "2021730704977200", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824556_2021730708310533_6538207973128942507_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FS2p844vjJgQ7kNvwG2Ct95&_nc_oc=AdnF7QOzqBZNTPTaxYA0Iz6t3qM1Dyum6jAJBIudKd94QehI3PEVlFgOCFf058a5lwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftqveoTjKrLWKfGNMylkgChLWpLuvLlnYbMAGB0H3N-zw&oe=6999B699"}, "display_name": "San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes", "keywords": ["Affreschi", "Assorestauro", "BSOD", "San", "Paolo"], "long_description": "**San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes - VR**\n\nStep into history like never before. Explore and uncover hidden masterpieces within the Church of San Paolo, a jewel in the heart of Ferrara. This app offers you a unique immersive experience, blending art and virtual reality technology to reveal precious frescoes that have remained hidden for centuries behind the walls of time.\n\n**Become the protagonist!**\n\nThanks to ultra-high-definition 3D scans and photogrammetric reconstructions, you'll virtually navigate the ancient spaces of the church. Reveal hidden frescoes, learn artistic and historical details, and relive the fascinating work of restorers.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- **Full Immersion:** Use your Meta Quest headset for an incredibly realistic journey back in time.\n- **Active Interaction:** Use intuitive virtual tools to discover details invisible to the naked eye.\n- **Guided Narration:** Deepen your understanding of the frescoes and the history of Ferrara through engaging storytelling filled with historical insights and interesting facts.\n\n**Ideal for:**\n\n- History, art, and culture enthusiasts.\n- Students and researchers looking for an interactive learning experience.\n- Tourists preparing for or extending their physical visits to Ferrara\u2019s historical sites.\n\nDiscover a unique cultural heritage. With \"San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes,\" experience the past firsthand and virtually contribute to preserving historical memory.\n\n**Install now and start your journey through time!**\n", "short_description": "Explore hidden frescoes, ancient chapels, and unveiled miracles. With this immersive VR experience, become a restorer for a day and uncover the secrets of Ferrara\u2019s cultural heritage like never before. Discover and reveal history in an interactive journey blending art, history, and technology.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "pano_test_lowres.png", "id": "1937208813750082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825045_1937208817083415_2308131944780557392_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9iDzPpg2rawQ7kNvwFcmeWd&_nc_oc=Adnt1U1pQd9ia4vJfo3TSdp2zl42zv90QDalMM1YI-HpnhIq7pRPtBreds3pht2XVG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuZM1_e00-yK8AqjaOTfRXbqioQprNIAalsYbCT_uBDjQ&oe=699995B6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero_SANPAOLO_1.png", "id": "1751691975409010", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824504_1751691978742343_6280807670428162182_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGFgOru3lKsQ7kNvwEf9sxE&_nc_oc=AdmWBWcn6RfMvquU67BWcGBPm8xj4PzIUxTmcKjK-zgR1s2ncQWjRFZIcW0-a23f28I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftp0G8bJ9oOmDtjWNtE-W7bt3sgC2HbQhr2uJoaKTmyVA&oe=6999B114"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_SANPAOLO.png", "id": "1243210453909475", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824513_1243210457242808_4833206868291161260_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DcZHph3jelYQ7kNvwE2McKy&_nc_oc=AdlmZ